OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of homes approved for
OL,4,Acity green wedge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA housing development of up to 350
OL,7,Fhomes can be build on land designated
OL,8,Fas green wedge in Derby, despite
OL,9,Fopposition.
OL,11,FDerby City Council approved the plans
OL,12,Ffor the east of Moorway Lane in
OL,13,FLittleover on Thursday.
OL,15,FThe site is on the protected Littleover
OL,16,Fand Sunnyhill green wedge - a planning
OL,17,Fdesignation designed to protect open
OL,18,Fareas of land between settlements.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
